OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits causing the death of
OL,4,Ahis son in hotel fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British man has pleaded guilty to
OL,7,Fcausing the death of his two-year-old
OL,8,Fson who fell from a hotel window in
OL,9,FCyprus.
OL,11,FThe father, from Essex, admitted a
OL,12,Fcharge of causing death through a
OL,13,Freckless, rash or dangerous act at a
OL,14,Fcourt in Paphos on Tuesday.
OL,16,FThe boy fell from the fourth floor of
OL,17,Fthe King Evelthon Beach Hotel and
OL,18,FResort in Chlorakas on 12 July, the
OL,19,FTimes had previously reported.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
